# AgilePlus pillar-based CODEOWNERS.
#
# Format mirrors GitHub's CODEOWNERS syntax. Each pillar owns a slice of the
# repo so PRs that touch a path automatically request review from the
# pillar owner. Owners listed here correspond to the 31 pillars in
# `agileplus/pillars/31-pillar-scorecard.json`.

# --- Code quality ---
/.github/workflows/         @KooshaPari  # pillar: code-quality
/rustfmt.toml               @KooshaPari  # pillar: code-quality
/.editorconfig              @KooshaPari  # pillar: code-quality

# --- Tests ---
/tests/                     @KooshaPari  # pillar: tests
**/*_test.go                @KooshaPari  # pillar: tests
